Seed inputs for the fuzz targets in arms/fuzz, one directory per target.

The SAPIENT messages in sapient_message/, tcp_frame/ and sapient_frame/ are protobuf
encodings of the reference vectors in arms/sapient-receiver/tests/vectors/true. The one
exception is the padded message at the start of sapient_frame/detect_tie_be.bin, which
is synthetic.

